apmond (1.0.0)
  * Add - apmon.cgi is generated at daemon startup and rewritten only if it differs, as mesh11sd does [bluewavenet]
  * Add - cgi_dir option to allow a web server package other than uhttpd, default /www/cgi-bin [bluewavenet]
  * Add - package removal hook deletes the generated apmon.cgi, upgrades leave it in place [bluewavenet]
  * Add - get_ap_data cli command, as mesh11sd, to show this node's own report [bluewavenet]
  * Add - optional vlan key on wireless client entries, per AP interface [bluewavenet]
  * Add - optional vlan key on wired client entries from UCI bridge-vlan, ip-bridge used only if installed [bluewavenet]
  * Add - support for vlan_filtering bridges, node and collector addresses use the lan VLAN interface [bluewavenet]
  * Add - wired client byte counts are labelled with "stats_scope": "port" [bluewavenet]
  * Add - status reports the running daemon checksum, the installed checksum and a warning if they differ [bluewavenet]
  * Add - unreachable collector and bad signature log lines hint to check that apmon_seed is the same on every node [bluewavenet]
  * Add - wired client bridges are auto detected when bridge is unset or auto, wan bridge and vxlan ports skipped [bluewavenet]
  * Add - all JSON output formatted as jq . does [bluewavenet]
  * Add - apmond_checksum in node_status, the sha256 of the apmond script, as mesh11sd_checksum [bluewavenet]
  * Add - collector checks apmond_protocol and warns on a mismatch [bluewavenet]
  * Add - running daemon is restarted on upgrade and on config change [bluewavenet]
  * Add - wired client speed from swconfig on VLAN interfaces, unknown instead of down [bluewavenet]
  * Add - logging as mesh11sd, log file in log_mountpoint, free space checks and read_log cli command [bluewavenet]
  * Add - optional log_mountpoint as mesh11sd, only verified reports are written to it [bluewavenet]
  * Add - router and collector auto detect, first come wins, back off and failover [bluewavenet]
  * Add - IPv6 ULA prefix and report signing secret derived from one passphrase, apmon_seed [bluewavenet]
  * Add - notice at start and every default_seed_warn_interval (6 hours) while the built-in default passphrase is in use, status shows passphrase_warning [bluewavenet]
  * Add - reports are signed, stale, replayed and tampered reports are rejected [bluewavenet]
  * Add - protocol v1, compatible with mesh11sd apmond [bluewavenet]
  * Add - status, show_ap_data, get_ap_data, send, cleanup, read_log and debuglevel cli commands [bluewavenet]
  * Add - apk packages conflict with mesh11sd [bluewavenet]
  * Add - standalone package, ported from mesh11sd apmond [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - daemon, cgi and cli always use the same log and data path, mesh11sd cli and cgi ignore log_mountpoint [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - log_mountpoint must be an exact mountpoint and writable, otherwise /tmp is used [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - apmon.cgi prints one blank line after Content-type, mesh11sd printf prints an extra one [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - passphrase is hashed with printf '%s' so % and \ are taken literally [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - race reading /proc/<pid>/cmdline gave can't open errors in status [bluewavenet]

